{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"一、十年，春王正月，公敗齊師于長勺。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"二、二月，公侵宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"曷為或言侵？或言伐？觕者曰侵，精者曰伐。戰不言伐，圍不言戰，入不言圍，滅不言入，書其重者也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"三、三月，宋人遷宿。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"遷之者何？不通也，以地遷之也。子沈子曰：「不通者，蓋因而臣之也。」","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"四、夏六月，齊師、宋師次于郎，公敗宋師乘丘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"其言次于郎何？伐也。伐則其言次何？齊與伐而不與戰，故言伐也。我能敗之，故言次也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"五、秋九月，荊敗蔡師于莘，以蔡侯獻舞歸。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"荊者何？州名也。州不若國，國不若氏，氏不若人，人不若名，名不若字，字不若子。蔡侯獻舞何以名？絕。曷為絕之？獲也。曷為不言其獲？不與夷狄之獲中國也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"六、冬十月，齊師滅譚，譚子奔莒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_39_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_39","textTraditional":"何以不言出？國以滅矣，無所出也。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}